    "prompt": "In a cozy pixel art garden workshop, Polli adjusts nine little Gemini and Nano Banana price tags beside a glowing Vertex terminal while code-plants grow from prominent lime green (#ecf874) pots. Polli, the main character, is a cute pixel art bee mascot with a yellow body and dark brown horizontal stripes, small black legs, two black antennae, black vertical oval eyes, bright pink rectangular blush marks on cheeks, a small happy smile, and small rounded light blue translucent wings; she is small-to-medium in the scene, wears tiny accountant glasses, and is strictly pixel art, never realistic. Cozy pixel art, 8-bit aesthetic, soft pastel gradients, warm lighting, retro gaming vibes, with a warm cream background and dark purple (#110518) outlines."
